----- Output Settings -------------------------------------------------------------------
          0   WrVTK         - VTK visualization data output: (switch) {0=none; 1=init; 2=animation}
         15   VTK_fps       - Frame rate for VTK output (frames per second) {will use closest integer multiple of DT} [used only if WrVTK=2]
